async function audioLoad(id){const blob=await getAudioClip(id);if(!blob)throw Error('Audio fayl topilmadi; u boshqa brauzer profili yoki tozalangan storage ichida bo‘lishi mumkin.');const el=$(`[data-audio-player="${CSS.escape(id)}"]`);if(!el)throw Error('Audio player topilmadi.');const old=audioObjectUrls.get(id);if(old)URL.revokeObjectURL(old);const url=URL.createObjectURL(blob);audioObjectUrls.set(id,url);el.src=url;await el.play().catch(()=>{});}
